│Step 1 of 10 · Meet IRMind                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                      │
│IRMind is a terminal assistant for investigating security incidents. The model proposes actions, policy decides what  │
│can run, and the case records signed evidence.                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                      │
│This presentation operates the product for you with synthetic data and a scripted model. Nothing leaves this computer,│
│and the temporary session is deleted when you exit.                                                                   │
